--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
 WHAT IT DOES AND WHY IT IS HERE
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

These modules contain the Pressure Advance analysis mathematics: they take a
loadcell pressure trace recorded during a K-value sweep and determine the
optimal K. That analysis is the hard part of automatic PA tuning, and Stefan
worked it out and published it. KlipperXL did not reinvent it and does not
claim it.

KlipperXL supplies the parts around it: capturing the trace from the Dwarf
loadcell over MODBUS, running the sweep, and storing a K per tool.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
 WHY IT IS VENDORED INSTEAD OF DOWNLOADED AT INSTALL TIME
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

A copy is included in this repository, rather than fetched from GitHub during
installation, so that KlipperXL remains buildable and installable even if the
upstream repository is renamed, made private, or taken offline. A firmware
project that cannot be rebuilt from its own sources is not reproducible.

The AGPL expressly permits redistribution on these terms.

